  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 3,000 left parenthesis 0.75 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3,000</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>0.75</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A conservation scientist implemented a program to reduce the population of a certain species in an area. The given function estimates this species' population <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> years after <math alttext=\"2008\"><mn>2008</mn></math>, where <math alttext=\"x less than or equals 8\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn></math>. Which of the following is the best interpretation of <math alttext=\"3,000\"><mn>3,000</mn>\n</math> in this context?</p>",
